# Cloudflare Pages redirects (ADR-0092 §4).
#
# English is served unprefixed, so `/en/*` must never become a second canonical
# form of the same page. There is no middleware in a static export, which is why
# this lives here rather than in the application.
/en/* /:splat 301

# `www` is a redirect to the apex, configured on the Pages project's custom
# domains rather than here — a redirects file cannot match on hostname.
